    ============================================================ -->
    <div class="page" id="page-faq">
        <section class="section section-dark" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title" style="padding-top:120px;">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-header" data-aos="fade-up">
                    <span class="section-label">Questions?</span>
                    <h2 class="section-title" id="faq-title">Frequently Asked <span>Questions</span></h2>
                    <p class="section-sub">Everything you need to know about working with Nami.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-list" data-aos="fade-up">
                    <div class="faq-item active">
                        <div class="faq-question" role="button" tabindex="0">
                            What digital marketing services do you offer?
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-answer">We offer a full suite of digital marketing services including website design, SEO, Google Ads, Facebook Ads, Instagram marketing, social media management, brand identity, graphic design, video editing, email marketing, content marketing, lead generation, local SEO, Google Business Profile optimisation, WhatsApp marketing, and AI video creation.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <div class="faq-question" role="button" tabindex="0">
                            How much do your services cost?
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-answer">Our pricing is customised based on your specific needs and goals. We offer flexible packages for businesses of all sizes. Contact us for a free consultation and we'll provide a tailored quote that fits your budget.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <div class="faq-question" role="button" tabindex="0">
                            How long does it take to see results?
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-answer">Results vary depending on the service. Some campaigns show initial results within 2-4 weeks, while SEO and brand building typically show significant results within 3-6 months. We provide regular reports and keep you updated on progress.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <div class="faq-question" role="button" tabindex="0">
                            Do you work with businesses outside India?
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-answer">Yes, we work with clients globally. Our team is experienced in serving businesses across different markets and time zones. We use modern collaboration tools to ensure seamless communication regardless of location.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <div class="faq-question" role="button" tabindex="0">
                            What makes Nami different from other agencies?
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-answer">Nami combines data-driven strategies with creative excellence. We're committed to transparency, regular reporting, and a partnership approach that focuses on your long-term growth. Our team brings deep expertise across all digital marketing disciplines.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <div class="faq-question" role="button" tabindex="0">
                            How do you measure success?
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-answer">We track key performance indicators (KPIs) aligned with your business goals — from website traffic and conversion rates to lead generation and ROI. You'll receive comprehensive reports that show exactly how your campaigns are performing.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <div class="faq-question" role="button" tabindex="0">
                            Do you offer ongoing support after the campaign?
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-answer">Absolutely. We believe in building long-term partnerships. We provide ongoing support, optimisation, and strategic guidance to ensure your campaigns continue to perform and adapt to market changes.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <div class="faq-question" role="button" tabindex="0">
                            Can you help with local SEO?
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-answer">Yes, we specialise in local SEO services. We optimise your Google Business Profile, manage local citations, and implement strategies to help you rank higher in local search results and attract customers in your area.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <div class="faq-question" role="button" tabindex="0">
                            What is the onboarding process like?
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-answer">Our onboarding process is smooth and collaborative. We start with a discovery session to understand your goals, then conduct a full audit of your current digital presence, and finally develop a custom strategy plan before launching any campaigns.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <div class="faq-question" role="button" tabindex="0">
                            Do you provide content for social media?
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-answer">Yes, our content marketing team creates engaging social media content, including graphics, videos, captions, and stories. We ensure your brand voice is consistent across all platforms and that content drives meaningful engagement.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

